stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Registered: Platform: POST /identifiers/{datasetId}

    Registered --> Active: Validation successful\n(XML valid, identifiers parsed)

    Registered --> Rejected: Validation failed\n(malformed XML, parse error → 400)

    Rejected --> [*]: Identifier not stored

    Active --> Active: Platform: POST /identifiers/{datasetId}\n(re-upload updates dataset XML)

    Active --> Expired: Background expiry job\n(createdAt < NOW() - 90 days)\ndeliveredAt set to NOW()

    Active --> Deleted: Admin: DELETE /admin/consignments/{datasetId}\n(immediate removal)

    Expired --> Deleted: Admin: DELETE /admin/consignments/{datasetId}\nOR cascaded delete

    Deleted --> [*]: Row removed from consignments\nand identifiers (CASCADE DELETE)

    note right of Active
        State: Active (deliveredAt IS NULL)
        - Search returns this identifier
        - Dataset XML accessible via /dataset/{gateId}/{platformId}/{datasetId}
        - Indexed in: identifiers table (id, countryCode)
        - Platform can update XML at any time
    end note

    note right of Expired
        State: Expired (deliveredAt IS NOT NULL)
        - Search does NOT return this identifier
        - Dataset may still be accessible via direct UIL
        - Expiry randomized: 03:45–05:45 local time
        - Purpose: spread load across EU gates
    end note

    note right of Deleted
        State: Deleted
        - Both consignment and identifiers rows removed
        - CASCADE DELETE on identifiers table
        - Not accessible via search or dataset endpoint
    end note
